{
  "id": "b2-e04-the-pressure-of-competition",
  "level": "B2",
  "version": 1,
  "topic": "The pressure of competition",
  "parts": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "title": "Interview",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p1-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Good afternoon. First of all, we'd like to know something about you.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e04-the-pressure-of-competition/p1-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4600
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q1",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, do you do any sport or exercise regularly?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e04-the-pressure-of-competition/p1-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4600
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q2",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, what sports are popular where you live?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e04-the-pressure-of-competition/p1-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 3800
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q3",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, do you like to compete, or do you prefer to take part just for fun?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e04-the-pressure-of-competition/p1-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5700
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q4",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, would you like to try a new sport? Why?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e04-the-pressure-of-competition/p1-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4200
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "title": "Long turn",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p2-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "In this part of the test, I'm going to give each of you two photographs. I'd like you to talk about them on your own for about a minute, and also to answer a question about your partner's photographs.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e04-the-pressure-of-competition/p2-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 13000
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "b2-e04-a1",
            "b2-e04-a2"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate A, your photographs show people doing sport. Compare the photographs, and say why the people might have chosen to do these activities.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e04-the-pressure-of-competition/p2-a.mp3",
          "audioMs": 9800
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate B, which of these activities would you prefer to do? Why?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e04-the-pressure-of-competition/p2-a-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5200
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "b2-e04-b1",
            "b2-e04-b2"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate B, your photographs show people preparing for sport. Compare the photographs, and say how the people might be feeling.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e04-the-pressure-of-competition/p2-b.mp3",
          "audioMs": 8800
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate A, do you think it is better to train alone or with a team? Why?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e04-the-pressure-of-competition/p2-b-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5400
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "title": "Collaborative task",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p3-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like you to talk about something together for about two minutes. Here are some things that can help young people enjoy competitive sport, and a question for you to discuss.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e04-the-pressure-of-competition/p3-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 11400
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-discuss",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 120,
          "diagram": "b2-e04-the-pressure-of-competition",
          "text": "Talk to each other about this question: How might these things help young people enjoy sport?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e04-the-pressure-of-competition/p3-discuss.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6500
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-decide",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "diagram": "b2-e04-the-pressure-of-competition",
          "text": "Now you have about a minute to decide together. Which would be the most important for a young player?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e04-the-pressure-of-competition/p3-decide.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6700
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "title": "Discussion",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p4-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like to ask you some more questions about sport and competition.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e04-the-pressure-of-competition/p4-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5100
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q1",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "Some people believe that competition in sport is bad for children. What do you think?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e04-the-pressure-of-competition/p4-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5800
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q2",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, why do you think some people stop playing sport when they get older?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e04-the-pressure-of-competition/p4-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5500
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q3",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, should schools give more importance to sport?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e04-the-pressure-of-competition/p4-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4100
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q4",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "Do you think professional sportspeople are good role models?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e04-the-pressure-of-competition/p4-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4200
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q5",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, how can sport help people in other parts of their lives?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e04-the-pressure-of-competition/p4-q5.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4900
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
